<resources>

    <!-- Base application theme.

         Material3 rather than AppCompat, deliberately: the HTML form elements
         draw platform chrome from the theme's Material colour roles
         (?attr/colorPrimary, ?attr/colorSecondaryContainer, ...), and this is
         also what a NEW Android app is themed with — which is the fidelity bar
         the elements are held to. DayNight keeps dark mode.

         The two text-colour overrides that used to live here are gone: they
         were an AppCompat-era adjustment, and overriding the theme's own text
         colours under Material3 would misstate exactly the roles the elements
         now read. -->
    <style name="AppTheme" parent="Theme.Material3.DayNight.NoActionBar" />

</resources>
